      "body": "We've had horrible IndexedDB for about a year now, in a Cordova app. We see no fix in sight, so our main recommendation is that people stay clear of it for now.\r\n\r\nEDIT. I should add that I've seen horrible performance in Chromium (Mac) as well, see: https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/firebase-talk/u1y7pYVhc48",
