      "updated_at": "2018-06-26T16:51:59Z",
      "body": "We're pretty sure its IndexedDB related. We'll do some more tests, but what we saw was this.\r\nDoing a simple `get({source: 'cache'})` (on a collection with few (<10) documents) took between 5-10 sec. After we deleted the database, it dropped to 500ms consistently.\r\nWe store orders, so we can quickly reach 100k documents (in total, across collections) and garbage collection for IndexedDB isn't implemented yet. So we're looking far and wide for alternatives.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
